<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 10 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 10 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.40 vs   0.66 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.76 vs   1.08</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.29 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Sales		   11.35 vs   8.84</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.03 vs   7.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	16.78 vs  12.46</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.74 vs  12.84</p>
<p> Sales		  127.91 vs  85.84</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionery is Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
